{
  "note": "Path globs each agent owns. An agent does not edit another agent's paths; a needed change outside your boundary is a request to the owner or an orchestrator decision. Files listed under `shared` are serialised through Agent 01 — concurrent edits to those are the main way a parallel build corrupts itself.",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-12",
  "shared": {
    "arbiter": "01",
    "paths": [
      "app/src/routes/index.tsx",
      "app/src/screens/registry.ts",
